  "title": "Corning Announces Strong First-Quarter 2026 Financial Results (1)",
  "summary": "Corning Incorporated (NYSE: GLW) today announced its first-quarter 2026 results and provided its outlook for second-quarter 2026. News Summary: First-quarter core sales grew 18% to $4.35 billion, and core EPS grew 30% to $0.70 versus Q1-2025. Robust demand for Gen AI products and the ramp of new solar products drove Q1 growth. Optical Communications sales grew 36%, and Solar sales were up 80% year over year. Two additional hyperscale customers entered into large, long-term agreements with Cornin",
